 "notes": "Concert flute, sustained with natural vibrato, mono. 10 notes C4-C7 every 3-5 semitones. Every file has a sustain loop (loopStart/loopEnd, crossfade baked in) chosen to span whole vibrato cycles. Low notes were boosted and the top octave cut by up to 10-12 dB to even out the flute's natural register imbalance. Recommended release 0.2 s.",
